00:11:48,850 --> 00:11:50,850
[HANS]
Absolutely!
ແນ່ນອນ!

207
00:11:51,350 --> 00:11:53,350
[ELSA]
Anna--
ແອນນາ...

208
00:11:53,850 --> 00:11:58,400
[ANNA]
